# Unlicensed artwork previews used for local design tests only
apps/mobile/public/art-test-*
apps/web/public/art-test-*

# Official checklist PDFs are never committed (converted locally into CSV facts only)
data/checklists/source/
*.pdf

# Unlicensed artwork previews (Adobe Stock comps) stay local
docs/img_2.png

# Official image originals (optimised copies live in apps/web/public/img)
data/images/topps/**
!data/images/topps/README.md

# Marketing visuals and their Remotion project live outside the repo (on the desktop).
marketing/

# Rendered social videos (pnpm video:duet), never committed.
exports/
